    },
    {
        "text": "Ngh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "text": "You... you took out all my buddies?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "...S-stay away from me! I'm begging you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "text": "I, I'll give you all my coins! My weapons! Anything you want...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where's the girl?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you talking about...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't come any closer...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "text": "You monster\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Clear \\ Visibility: 14 km",
        "tag": "name"
    },
    {
        "text": "Forest at the foot of Mt. Terrat",
        "tag": "name"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_forest",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$m_dia_street_intro",
        "key": "$m_dia_street_loop",
        "volume": 0.6,
        "crossfade": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "This rock...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stay close to me, you two. Watch your step, and stay inside my footprints. Don't go around touching things either.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm afraid this forest is even more dangerous than we suspected.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_220_grani#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is something carved on that rock?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "These are marks left behind by bounty hunters. We need to take heed of these, or we may well end up stepping in a trap.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "So, how are we going to avoid the traps?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just watch me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "text": "An animal trap on a rope... how old-fashioned.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010"
    },
    {
        "text": "Here's a rolling log trap, hidden by the foliage. Would've tripped it if we rushed forward.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "text": "Miss Carol, watch your step.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "avg_npc_003",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Uh, huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carol"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "avg_npc_003",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "If you take another step in that direction, there's probably a spiked pitfall waiting for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "avg_npc_003",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Carol"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_220_grani#3"
    },
    {
        "text": "You sure are the real deal. You're pretty good at this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course. After all, I used to...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's not realistic to go around all the traps. Looks like we'll have to disarm some of them after all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "text": "The most perilous path for them will soon become the safest path for us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$darkness01_intro",
        "key": "$darkness01_loop",
        "volume": 0.6,
        "crossfade": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "text": "Something's not right here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Is it a trap?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "text": "A symbol drawn with blood...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "text": "'...Monster?'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's the meaning of this? In all my years, I've never seen a symbol like this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Oh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is this what I think it is...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "Monster... Monster!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "text": "D-don't come this way!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Bounty Hunter"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#1",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_220_grani#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_220_grani#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "It was you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#2",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#3",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Skadi, you're Skadi, right?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#2",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#3",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...So, the chief of Dewville was with you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#2",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? You know Carol...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#2",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hand her over to me. Now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010"
    },
    {
        "text": "Grani, something's not right about her eyes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_220_grani#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't just do that. Let's talk this over peacefully\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_220_grani#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "H-huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
