    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_263_skadi#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "That was just a warning.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Skadi"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_220_grani#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "No! Miss Carol, Big Bob...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Wh-why would she attack you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "text": "You know each other right, so why\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Big Bob"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_010",
        "name2": "char_220_grani#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No time to explain! Run for it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Grani"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
